<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>{{ basics.name }} - Cover Letter</title>
    <style>
        @page { size: Letter; margin: 0.72in 0.78in; }
        :root { --ink: #171717; }
        * { box-sizing: border-box; }
        body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 1.45; color: var(--ink); margin: 0; }
        .header { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 15pt; }
        h1 { font-family: Georgia, serif; font-size: 22pt; margin: 0 0 2pt; font-weight: bold; }
        .role-title { font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 5pt; }
        .contact-info { font-size: 8.8pt; line-height: 1.45; }
        a { color: var(--ink); text-decoration: none; }
        .date, .recipient, .subject { margin-bottom: 16pt; }
        .subject { font-weight: bold; }
        .content p { margin: 0 0 13pt; }
        .signature { margin-top: 21pt; }
        .signature-name { margin-top: 28pt; font-weight: bold; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <header class="header">
        <h1>{{ basics.name }}</h1>
        <div class="role-title">{{ basics.label }}</div>
        {% if headline %}<div>{{ headline }}</div>{% endif %}
        <div class="contact-info">{{ basics.location }} | {{ basics.phone }} | <a href="mailto:{{ basics.email }}">{{ basics.email }}</a></div>
        <div class="contact-info"><a href="{{ basics.linkedin }}">LinkedIn: {{ basics.linkedin|replace('https://', '')|replace('http://', '')|trim('/') }}</a> | <a href="{{ basics.github }}">GitHub: {{ basics.github|replace('https://', '')|replace('http://', '')|trim('/') }}</a> | <a href="{{ basics.portfolio }}">Portfolio: {{ basics.portfolio|replace('https://', '')|replace('http://', '')|trim('/') }}</a></div>
    </header>
    <div class="date">{{ date }}</div>
    <div class="recipient">{{ recipient.name }}{% if recipient.title %}<br>{{ recipient.title }}{% endif %}{% if recipient.company %}<br>{{ recipient.company }}{% endif %}{% if recipient.address %}<br>{{ recipient.address }}{% endif %}</div>
    <div class="subject">Re: Application for {{ role_title }} Position</div>
    <div class="content">
        <p>Dear {{ recipient.name }},</p>
        {% if custom_cover_letter_body %}{% for paragraph in custom_cover_letter_body.split('\n\n') %}<p>{{ paragraph }}</p>{% endfor %}{% else %}
        <p>I am writing to express my strong interest in the {{ role_title }} position. As a {{ basics.label }} with a background in {{ background_context }}, I am excited about the opportunity to contribute to your team.</p>
        <p>{{ summary }}</p>
        <p>My technical foundation in {{ skills.programming[:4]|join(', ') }} supports careful implementation, testing, and documentation. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my experience aligns with your needs.</p>
        <p>Thank you for your time and consideration.</p>{% endif %}
    </div>
    <div class="signature">Sincerely,<div class="signature-name">{{ basics.name }}</div></div>
</body>
</html>
